# Server

Tags: server

## Server information is available without credentials
* Connect anonymously
* Server information reports "Welcome"
* Server is up

## UUIDs can be requested in bulk
* Connect as admin
* Request "5" UUIDs and receive "5" unique values

## Replication scheduler is available
* Connect as admin
* The replication scheduler lists jobs and documents

## Database events feed
* Connect as admin
* Creating a database shows up in the database updates feed
